            "notes": "Even with the Nerf Brig received earlier this week, Her Sk\u00f6ld Combos are still terrifying and able to one shot every single Squishy if timed right. \n\nwe go [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) and [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for the immediate bonuses they provide, and [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) for its immense bonus stats after we Rally.\n\nThis is a callout in general, dont sleep on charged plating, 25 armor and 10AP after using your ult once can make you much more of a menace in earlier rounds!",
