            "notes": "Round 2, We  buy [Multi-tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) for more AP and the little bit of CDR. We also buy [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) as it gives us more AP and some health.\n\nImportant: If you got enough Money R1 and can buy [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4), doing so into certain Tanks like Junker Queen and Orisa can be extremely Valuable. Being able to Spam a single Rally more during the round can make or break the round. Do NOT buy it R2 into Sig, Rein and Winston, since their shields will just block you out of your throws and you do not yet have the sustain to run into a Winston bubble without dying\n\n if you have enough Money to buy [Vitality Amplifier](item_6b52b1c9-a924-4a93-8545-a1c205cf6927) or [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6), go for these, as Vitality amplifier allows our Shieldbash and Whip to come off cooldown faster and heal us a bit when we are low, and Give us more AP when we are topped off, ontop of just giving us 25 Shields by itself.If you have enough money to buy Nano Cola instead, go for it, as 30% AP initially will let you pressure Opponents far better with your shield throws. \n\nif you do not have enough money for Multi-Tool though, go for [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e), since they still give us the 10 AP, and the 10 Ability lifesteal and Health are nice bonuses. Top off the Rest of your items with Common Survival items\n\nIf they have an [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) or a Character like Ashe going for a Burn build, Buy [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f). Not only does it Reduce Sleep and Nade duration for Ana, it also reduces the Burn duration from any and all sources. \n\n[Bloodbound](item_d873e953-93cd-4b0d-8669-33184127cc3c) Is worth Mentioning too, as you can pull some silly stuff with it. I Tried it on a whim and thought nothing of it, but especially if you die to the enemy Carry, the Reveal alone is worth all the Money in the world, as you can give your Team crucial information through pings, but also receiving less damage from them is a godsend. Try it out sometime if your team is having problem with one person running everyone over!",
