            "notes": "Now we get to the Fun Part: Farming Rally. We want to pick [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0), as it Couples extremely nicely with the multiple Inspire Procs off [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) and Improves ours and our Teams survivability by a LOT. you should also buy [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) here, as it is imperative for building your ult Quickly. \n\nShould you not have enough cash to affor Scavenged Steel, Sell Armored Vest or Power Playbook first, since Charged Plating is going to Provide is with the stats of Both items in practically no time through Scavenged Steel. \n\nIf you have money to Spare and cannot afford [Dragons' Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) without selling your Rares, Upgrade Power playbook into any of the Rare AP items and/or Armored vest into [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016), otherwise Get Dragons Incin, as it is the other of our Core Items together with Scavenged Steel",
