            "created_at": "2025-10-04T01:44:26.053194+00:00",
            "notes": "This is arguably the Round where the build becomes the most fun: We can Sustain our Team with Aurafarming, and we Farm and Ult that becomes Ridiculous. [Dragons' Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) allows us to pretty much just walk up on the enemies without much Resistance during Rally, given you have your team with you to follow up. I have tried and failed several times, so i implore people to not try and 1v3/4 with Rally while you dont have your team there. Yes, you can Jump into the enemy backline with rally and get insane Value, but your team needs to follow that up with huge pressure from the tank.\n\nOf course we want to buy [Dragons' Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) to Complete our 2-Item Core, but if you have enough Money, Upgrade Either Multi-Tool or Power Playbook to the following Items depending on the Situation:\n\n[Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c): Probably the Singular most overpowered general Item in all of Stadium rn, if you feel you are dying too quickly during fights, this is your go to Item to be able to take even more hits.\n\n[Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8): This is an Excellent AP Item for Brig and one of the only 2 We will consider for The end of this build. It provides us even more survivability in the form of regenerating our Armor whenever we Bash or Whip, while increasing our overall Damage with Shieldthrow a bit.\n\n[Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d): Pick this and [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) against any tracer thats pressuring you. Even if she has [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27), the Extra damage reduction from Ogundimu and the Extra Armor from Vital-E-Tee is going to make it much, much harder for her to approach you, especially since her HP nerfs this week made her more Vulnerable Late Game\n\nAlso, Small Tip from someone with a lot of Experience in blocking Shatters: If you have ult and dont have a Tank that can Block [Earthshatter](ability_f8f0fa28-b544-4a28-b074-146e7087fc3a), you can have their Team break your shield, baiting the Rein to use his Ultimate. You can Ult and Block his Shatter with your shield, which you can Easily Translate into a won Teamfight in most situations",
