            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-10-04T01:44:26.053194+00:00",
            "notes": "Youve made it to Round 5, heres your Reward: [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) is an amazing Power, giving us more Ult Charge for our first Rally, but also Applying Overhealth to anyone Within our rally every 1.5s and giving us our cooldowns back faster. \n\nIn Terms of Items, we want to Pick up [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) here. Its already Insane Value on every single Hero in the Game, but During Rally, you will Rarely die with this item Equipped. \n\nthis round, if you have more money than the build Commands, Replace either Multi-Tool or Charged Plating with either Lumerico Fusion Drive or [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e). Ive had my fair share of building both Items, and both have their Upsides. While Lumerico gives us the advantage in fights with the Extra Armor Regen, Iridescent Iris gives us 100 overhealth to top us off when Popping Rally and Provides us with 5% More AP And 10% Cooldown Reduction, easily the most broken stat in the game next to movement Speed. i can Recommend to use Lumerico in situations where you are up against multiple Dive heroes, and use Iridescent The rest of the time.\n\n[Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) is an Extremely strong Pickup into a Specific Build: Shield Tank Reinhardt. Most of these Reinhardt Builds that ive seen use mostly survivability items, with the only Damage boosting item ive mostly seen being [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) Itself. Gloomgauntlet not only lets you farm its procs off of these Reins, as they do not have the burst potential to actively threaten you, but also makes you nigh Unkillable when  attacking Reinhardt during Rally. it is also Somewhat good into AP Rein, not as much tho, and i wouldnt pick it into WP Rein: WP Rein is going to run over you like you run over Tank Rein during Rally",
