            "notes": "Theres actually not to talk a lot about this round: We Definitely buy [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) or [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e), Depending on our Matchups, And if we have Enough money we sell Multi-Tool for Either [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d), [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) or [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8). Nebula Conduit is new on the list of Epic Items presented in this build, but it pairs Nicely with Divine Intervention, as Divine Procs of Pre-Mitigation Damage and Nebula Conduit gives us 15% Damage reduction to have that Damage applied over 3s, but it can also Pair very nicely With [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) on Kiriko, Since it counts as a Debuff and gives her extra ult charge (Thank you Neuro for teaching us this Interaction, not so much thank you for the Torment of AP Kiri before Midseason 3).",
