            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-10-04T01:44:26.053194+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 7. Youve given it your all to get here, and you wanna finish this game with a Win. ill go over the 3 Different Powers i recommend Picking this round (a shocker, given the other 3 have had no alternative in this build)\n\n[Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3): An amazing Power, Proccing our Aura Farming off the Inspire on Bash, all whilst repairing our Shield by 33% of its max Health in the process. this is my go to Power to finish off this build\n\n[Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753): While i think this power is neat, it doesnt cut it in my Top 4, The biggest upside to this is being able to Bash multiple people with it, which gives us multiple [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) Triggers off one Bash, Potentially.\n\n[Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8): This Power is also really really Solid, Especially in a Tanky build like this. This power not only Helps you keep your teammates up an Extra bit (although Aura Farming really should be enough) It also gives you even more Survivability. Just throw a pack to your Support and heal yourself too by a reasonable amount.\n\nNow lets get to the Items. by this point, we should reach Full-Build. We sell the rest of our blue item(s) (depending on how many you have left), and round out our Build with [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) and [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d). You should have about 640 HP now, which gives you and everyone in Inspire distance 32 Overheal per Ability Inspire proc, which, of course, includes Shield throw. as you most likely already noticed, most of the Support to your team doesnt come from Inspire or Health packs, it comes in the form of Overhealth and the Damage you mitigate because of it.\n\nIf youve read this far, I really hope you enjoyed this build! ive had a lot of fun Fine-Tuning this build for myself and i hope i could convince you of the power of this build!",
